{"id":"work-6642","sourceIds":{"anilist":1181,"mal":1181},"info":{"title":"Ruin Explorers Fam & Ihrie","originalTitle":"Hikyou Tanken Fam & Ihrlie","synopsis":"Fam e Ihrie sono due esploratrici di rovine (Ruin Explorers) il cui scopo è di trovare l'Ultimate Power sigillato in tre antiche reliquie appartenenti ad un'epoca passata dominata dalla magia. Questo potere è difatti l'unico a poter sciogliere la maledizione che affligge Ihrie, potente strega il cui aspetto cambia ad ogni incantesimo lanciato...","type":"series","status":"completed","statusLabel":"Finito","audio":"Giapponese","dubbed":false,"releaseDateLabel":"25 Giugno 1995","year":1995,"season":"Primavera 1995","studios":["Ajia-Do"],"genres":["Avventura","Azione","Commedia","Fantasy","Magia"],"durationLabel":"29 min","declaredEpisodeCount":4,"availableEpisodeCount":4,"rating":6.2,"ratingCount":10,"views":543,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o0SzcTlilsTxbERmY9LLH5o5816.jpg","shareImage":{"base":"animeworld:img","path":"/copertine/uCcPi.png"},"sourceType":"OVA","tags":["OVA","Finito","1995"],"extra":{"ids":{"anilistIds":[1181],"malIds":[1181],"anidbIds":[392],"imdbMovieIds":[],"imdbShowIds":[],"tmdbMovieIds":[],"tmdbShowIds":[80188],"tvdbMovieIds":[],"tvdbShowIds":[72446]},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:1181","mal:1181"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-v2","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"392","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1181","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1181","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80188","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72446","scope":"s1","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}}]},"metadataTargets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"392","scope":"R","raw":"anidb:392:R","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"1181","raw":"anilist:1181","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"1181","raw":"mal:1181","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"80188","scope":"s1","raw":"tmdb_show:80188:s1","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72446","scope":"s1","raw":"tvdb_show:72446:s1","ranges":{"1-4":"1-4"}}],"imdbId":"tt0246901","sourceIds":{"anilist":1181,"mal":1181},"tmdb":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":80188,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/80188","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T18:49:43.347Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"Ruin Explorers Fam & Ihrie","language":"en-US"},"originalTitle":"秘境探検ファム＆イーリー","overview":{"value":"Fam and Ihrie are ruin explorers, scraping out a living by digging relics from the ruins of a lost age when magic ruled the world. Ihrie is a formidable sorceress with a catch: a curse turns her into a small furry creature every time she casts a spell. Breaking it means finding the Ultimate Power, sealed behind three relics — and they're not the only ones hunting it. Rival treasure hunters, a prince whose kingdom was destroyed, and the dark sorcerer Ruguduroll are all after the same prize, in a comic fantasy adventure.","language":"en-US"},"startDate":"1995-06-25","endDate":"1996-02-25","status":"Ended","rating":6.5,"ratingCount":10,"numberOfEpisodes":4,"numberOfSeasons":1,"genres":["Animazione","Action & Adventure","Commedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"30m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":112277,"name":"Michiko Neya","role":"Ihrie (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A1mqjatShQZJSTXFdm4fTkQXv83.jpg"},{"id":935083,"name":"Hekiru Shiina","role":"Fam (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eBFDy18brsCTlZ8TrxBo8kTEEUD.jpg"},{"id":142704,"name":"Kenichi Ogata","role":"Gil (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iQLEawIP2593yrGy22GzLSpnfgl.jpg"},{"id":20664,"name":"Koichi Yamadera","role":"Migel (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/biov5jENp2XYfehkcdnRvi796Wi.jpg"},{